# GodSmith MeleeOddities (P5) weapon descriptions
# Keys composed by the framework: Mods.CalamityOverhaul.GodSmithMeleeOddities.{SchemeClass}.Desc

GsVampireKnives.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: hurls 4-8 knives that heal 7.5% of damage dealt;
	stolen blood condenses into up to 3 orbiting blood pearls, each adding a knife to the next throw;
	at 3 pearls the next throw is a crimson volley with doubled lifesteal
	'''
GsScourgeoftheCorruptor.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: the javelin bursts into a brood of tiny eaters on impact;
	it also pins a festering sore on whatever it strikes - eaters dive at the sore,
	and after three passes the sore ruptures with cursed flames
	'''
GsSolarEruption.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: lashes out a looping chain-blade that pierces walls and detonates sunlight on hit;
	land 8 hits to charge a corona - the next lash ignites its whole path in a chain of blasts
	'''
GsDayBreak.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: spears stick and burn, up to 8 per target;
	pinning 4 spears into one target detonates them into a cross of daylight
	'''
GsSickle.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: still harvests hay from grass.
	Slashes build Harvest, each stack swinging a little faster;
	at 5 stacks the next slash becomes a widened reaping sweep
	'''
GsIceSickle.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: the thrown sickle freezes into an ice prism where it stops;
	shatter the prism with a slash to burst a fan of icicles forward
	'''
GsDeathSickle.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: the wall-piercing scythe grows a tier for each new enemy it reaps;
	at three tiers it erupts in a ring of soulfire where it halts
	'''
GsTerragrim.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: hold to become a storm of blades while Growth builds;
	release to loose a blade wave scaled by Growth - at full power it takes the shape of the Terra Blade
	'''
GsArkhalis.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: the flurry pierces 20 armor;
	sustained hits on one target build Insight, each stack adding 2 more armor penetration,
	and at 8 stacks the flurry snaps into a piercing execution thrust
	'''
GsMonkStaffT1.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: the ground slam still deals triple damage in an area, and you can still turn or cut the spin short;
	slammed enemies grow drowsy and slow, and a third slam on the same target puts it to sleep -
	that slam hits harder and slows longer
	'''
GsMonkStaffT2.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: every landed thrust calls a ghast to pierce a nearby enemy;
	the ghast then circles its victim for one more bite
	'''
GsMonkStaffT3.Desc:
	'''
	Reforged: left-click swings build Dragon Breath, lighting up the pearl on the staff;
	at 5 stacks the right-click dragon sphere ascends, calling down lightning along its path
	'''
